0..37 Comment "//! Products and records satisfy eta."
38..41 Comment "//!"
42..88 Comment "//! A pair equals the pair of its projections."
89..134 Comment "//! A record equals the record of its fields."
135..138 Comment "//!"
139..208 Comment "//! A neutral product converts to its projected tuple on either side."
209..251 Comment "//! Reflexivity proves the resulting path."
